## 3. Architecture decision

The implementation extends the existing intended execute-action chain instead of adding an unrelated public wrapper.

The existing modules already provided:

```text
runtime/bus/actionEnvelope.mjs
  raw action envelope validation / normalization

runtime/bus/executeAction/capabilityBusExecuteActionPlan.mjs
  raw actionEnvelope + registries -> accepted execute-action plan

runtime/bus/executeAction/capabilityBusExecuteActionOrchestration.mjs
  accepted execute-action plan -> executable orchestration descriptor

runtime/bus/executeAction/capabilityBusExecuteActionExecution.mjs
  orchestration descriptor -> executable nativeWorkerBackend dispatch

runtime/backends/nativeWorker/nativeWorkerBackendExecution.mjs
  nativeWorkerBackend/text.generate adapter execution using injected runNativeTextRequest
```

The missing branch piece was public dispatch composition and a default built-in registry bundle for the current `text.generate -> nativeWorkerBackend` route.

