## 5. Public API behavior

`runtime.mjs` still exports exactly:

```text
cancelPrompt
executeAction
initModel
prompt
resetModel
resetSession
shutdownRuntime
```

`executeAction(actionInput, options = {})` now accepts:

```text
raw action envelopes for the built-in text.generate/nativeWorkerBackend route
existing accepted execute-action orchestration descriptors
```

The existing orchestration-descriptor path remains supported through the same execute-action behavior seam.

Invalid raw envelopes reject before native request creation. Missing `input.prompt` rejects inside the nativeWorkerBackend adapter before the injected `runNativeTextRequest(...)` helper is called.

Cancellation remains unchanged:

```text
executeAction(...) returns requestId
cancelPrompt(requestId) remains the cancellation mechanism
cancelAction(actionId) remains future work
```

---

## 6. Default registry bundle

Added:

```text
runtime/bus/executeAction/defaultExecuteActionRegistries.mjs
```

Primary export:

```js
createDefaultExecuteActionRegistries()
```

The module creates a narrow default registry bundle for one built-in route:

```text
capability: text.generate
routeId: text-generate-default
serviceId: text.generate.default
backendKind: nativeWorkerBackend
adapterId: native-worker.default
modelBundleId: mistral-text-local
hardwareProfileId: laptopFallback
```

It uses existing registry and nativeWorkerBackend adapter definition helpers. It does not execute actions and does not import `runtime.mjs`, `workerBridge.mjs`, `llama_worker/**`, scheduler, request, stream, lifecycle, or native/model modules.

---

## 7. Dispatch helper

Added:

```text
runtime/bus/executeAction/capabilityBusExecuteActionDispatch.mjs
```

Primary exports:

```js
looksLikeRawActionEnvelope(value)
runExecuteActionDispatch(actionInput, deps = {}, options = {})
```

Behavior:

```text
if actionInput looks like a raw action envelope:
  use deps.executeActionRegistries or createDefaultExecuteActionRegistries()
  assertCapabilityBusExecuteActionPlan(actionInput, registries)
  normalizeCapabilityBusExecuteActionOrchestrationDescriptor(plan)
  runExecuteAction(orchestration, deps, options)

otherwise:
  runExecuteAction(actionInput, deps, options)
```

Shape detection is conservative. It avoids treating existing execute-action plans or orchestration descriptors as raw envelopes.

---

## 8. Runtime composition

`runtime.mjs` now imports:

```js
runExecuteActionDispatch
```

`executeAction(...)` now injects the parent-owned native text helper through dispatch:

```js
export async function executeAction(actionInput, options = {}) {
    return runExecuteActionDispatch(actionInput, {
        runNativeTextRequest
    }, options);
}
```

`runtime.mjs` remains the composition root. `runNativeTextRequest(...)`, `prompt(...)`, `cancelPrompt(...)`, init, reset, shutdown, scheduler, stream, request, and lifecycle behavior were not otherwise changed.

