Affected surface:
  local native/model resource stability, not execute-action dispatch logic.
Why it matters:
  The first run could look like a branch failure if read without the successful rerun.
Smallest safe correction:
  Record the failure as transient native context allocation/resource pressure.
What still needs verification:
